  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia dikumi ne muanda mukulu tshia mu bukelenge bua Yalobama, Abiya wakabanga kukokesha mu Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakakokesha mu Yelushalema bidimu bisatu; dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Mikaya, muana mukashi wa Uliele wa mu Gibea. Abiya ne Yalobama bakadi baluangana nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya wakasa mualu wa nvita ne bena nvita ba bukitu binunu nkama inai; Yalobama wakaluangana nʼandi ne bena nvita ba bukitu binunu nkama muanda mukulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya wakimana ha mutu ha mukuna wa Semalayima mu luseke lua mikuna ya Efelayima, wakamba ne, Unvuai, Yalobama ne Bena Isalele bonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanuena bamanye ne, Yehowa Nzambi wa Isalele, wakaha bukelenge bua Isalele kudi Davidi tshiendelele, kudiye ne kudi bana bandi balume ku tshihungidi tshia luehu, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, muena mudimu wa Solomo, muana wa Davidi, wakajuka, wakatombokela mukelenge wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bilumelume ne bantu ba hatuhu bakadisangisha kudiye, bakadikolesha bua kuhidia Lehabama, muana wa Solomo, hakadi Lehabama nsongalume wa mutshima mutekete, kakadi ne bukole bua kubakandamena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka nuenu nudi nuelangana meji bua kuhumbisha bukelenge bua Yehowa budi mu bianza bia bana ba Davidi; nuenu nudi tshisumbu tshinene, nudi ne bana ba ngombe ba or bakatulabo kudi Yalobama bu nzambi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuakibata bakuidi ba Yehowa, bana ba Alona, ne Bena Lewi, kanuakadisunguila bakuidi bu mudi tshilele tshia bantu ba mu makelenge makuabo, anyi? Nunku muntu yonso walua kudijidila ne muana mulume wa ngombe ne bimpanga muanda mutekete, yeye mene udi mua kuikala muakuidi kudi nzambi ya hatuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bua tuetu, Yehowa udi Nzambi wetu, katuakamulekela; tudi ne bakuidi, bana ba Alona, ne Bena Lewi badi bakuatshila Yehowa mudimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bobo badi bafila milambu ya kuosha ne musenga wa manananshi kudi Yehowa ku dinda ku dinda ne ku dilolo ku dilolo; badi bateka bidia bilesha ha mesa a tshijila kabidi; badi batemesha minda idi ha bitekelu bia or ku dilolo ku dilolo kabidi; bualu bua tuetu tudi tulonda mukenji wa Yehowa Nzambi wetu; kadi nuenu nuakumlekela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangilai, Nzambi udi nʼetu ku mutu kuetu, ne bakuidi bandi badi ne mpungi ya kuela bua kunudimusha. Nuenu Bena Isalele, kanuluanganyi ne Yehowa, Nzambi wa bankambua benu; bualu bua kanuena mua kumuhita bukole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yalobama wakamana kuteka bâlaminyi ku nyima kuabo; nunku bakuabo bakadi ku mpala kua Bena Yuda, ne bâlaminyi bakadi ku nyima kuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatangila Bena Yuda ku nyima, monai, bakadi baluangana ku nyima kuabo ne ku mpala kuabo kabidi; bakadila kudi Yehowa, ne bakuidi bakela mpungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha diba adi Bena Yuda bakela mbila; hakela Bena Yuda mbila, Nzambi wakalekesha Yalobama ne Bena Isalele bonso ku mpala kua Abiya ne Bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bakanyema ku mpala kua Bena Yuda; Nzambi wakabafila mu bianza biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya ne bantu bandi bakabashiha ne kushiha kukole; Bena Isalele ba bukitu binunu nkama itanu bakadishinda hanshi bafue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Bena Isalele bakateketa tshikondo atshi, ne Bena Yuda bakabahita bukole bualu bua bobo bakeyemena Yehowa, Nzambi wa bankambua babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya wakalonda ku nyima kua Yalobama, wakamunyenga misoko yandi; Betele ne misoko yakadi ha buihi, ne Yeshana ne misoko yakadi ha buihi, ne Efelona ne misoko yakadi ha buihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalobama kakaheta bukole kabidi mu matuku a Abiya; Yehowa wakamushiha, wakafua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Abiya wakalua muena bukole bua bungi; wakabaka bakashi dikumi ne banai, wakalela nʼabo bana ba balume makumi abidi ne babidi ne bana ba bakashi dikumi ne basambombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Abiya bikuabo ne midimu yandi ne mei andi bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola wa Ido muprofete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
